singanywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/528350c3-b1d2-4f87-b46d-a63e93277b32.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/528350c3-b1d2-4f87-b46d-a63e93277b32.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/528350c3-b1d2-4f87-b46d-a63e93277b32.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/528350c3-b1d2-4f87-b46d-a63e93277b32.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/528350c3-b1d2-4f87-b46d-a63e93277b32.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/528350c3-b1d2-4f87-b46d-a63e93277b32.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/7144b41d-2281-45fc-91aa-c91b6bd35b72.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/7144b41d-2281-45fc-91aa-c91b6bd35b72.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/7144b41d-2281-45fc-91aa-c91b6bd35b72.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/7144b41d-2281-45fc-91aa-c91b6bd35b72.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/7144b41d-2281-45fc-91aa-c91b6bd35b72.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632141/7144b41d-2281-45fc-91aa-c91b6bd35b72.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"PREMIUM TEMPORARY HOME IN CARMELITE MONASTERY: DESIGNER FURNITURE, CLEANING SERVICE, EV CHARGER, ACCESSIBLE\n\n\"This apartment isn't for everyone. But if you need to be flexible, appreciate quality, and have no time for compromises – then it's perfect for you.\"\n\nFOR THOSE WHO SEEK QUALITY, NOT COMPROMISES\n\nNew city. New job. New chapter. You don't need just any apartment – you need a genuine premium home where you can start living from day one – with designer furniture instead of IKEA, with professional cleaning every 14 days instead of weekend chores, with everything you need already in place.\n\nYou want to arrive and simply live. That's exactly what this apartment is for.\n\nDOES THIS SOUND LIKE YOU?\n\nYou're coming to Bamberg for 6 to 18 months:\nAs an international professional for a project at Bosch, Brose, or another company\nAs a consultant, interim manager, or professional on assignment\nAs an academic or visiting professor at the University of Bamberg\nIn a transitional situation (divorce, house construction, career change)\nOr you simply want to stay flexible without long-term commitments\n\nYou don't want to live in an anonymous hotel. But you have neither the time nor the desire to furnish an empty apartment only to dissolve everything again in a year.\n\nYou want to arrive, turn the key – and live.\n\nWELCOME TO YOUR FIRST-OCCUPANCY HOME IN THE CARMELITE MONASTERY\n\nImagine: You open the door to a 61 m2 apartment that has just been completed after extensive renovation. Not a worn-out temporary solution, but a stylish, fully equipped home where no one has lived before you.\n\nWHAT THIS MEANS FOR YOU IN PRACTICE:\n\nYour first evening:\nYou put down your suitcase, log into the WiFi (200 Mbit fiber optic, LAN in all rooms), and cook something in the brand-new designer kitchen. No assembly, no delivery dates, no compromises. Everything is there, everything works.\n\nYour daily life:\nMorning coffee in the fully equipped kitchen, evening relaxation in the light-filled living room or on your private patio in the monastery garden. Underfloor heating ensures a cozy atmosphere, the washing machine is ready, and if you need to work in the evening, you have stable internet and a TV for unwinding afterward. Cleaning service every 14 days – you don't have to worry about anything.\n\nYour weekend:\nA 10-minute walk takes you to Bamberg's UNESCO World Heritage Old Town – one of Germany's most beautiful cities. Bars, restaurants, culture, history. Your car is parked in your own outdoor space with an EV charging station (yes, really!).\n\nWHY THIS APARTMENT IS DIFFERENT\n\nHISTORY MEETS MODERNITY\nYou're living in the Carmelite Monastery – a landmark ensemble from the 14th century that has just been extensively renovated. The thick walls tell stories while you live in a brand-new, high-quality furnished first occupancy. This isn't an ordinary new building or standard old building. This is unique.\n\nTRULY FULLY EQUIPPED\nPremium furnishings with design pieces: Original artworks on the walls, selected designer furniture, and high-quality home textiles – not IKEA standard, but genuine quality for the highest standards\nOak parquet flooring throughout the apartment\nNew designer kitchen with all appliances\nTwo TVs, washing machine, dryer, hairdryer – everything's there\nBed linen, towels – even starter packages for kitchen and bathroom on request\nProfessional cleaning every 14 days included – you live, we take care of the rest\n\nACCESSIBLE & COMFORTABLE\nBarrier-free access, elevator, thoughtful room layout. Whether you have mobility challenges or simply appreciate comfort – everything here is well designed.\n\nYOUR PRIVATE OASIS\nExclusive patio in the monastery garden – just for you\nCellar compartment for your belongings\nBike cellar for your mobility in the city\n\nFUTURE-PROOF\nEV charging station at your own parking space, 200 MBit fiber optic internet, WLAN, LAN in every room. You're well set up here – professionally and personally.\n\nTHE TERMS – TRANSPARENT AND FAIR\n\nRent: €1,890 warm (€1,100 cold + €790 utilities / furniture flat rate)\n\nWhat's included in the utilities:\nHeating, water, electricity (flat rate for typical single-person household)\nInternet and cable TV\nFacility management\nProfessional cleaning every 14 days\nFurniture surcharge\n\nWhat you pay additionally:\nElectricity for EV charging station (based on consumption)\nDeposit: €3,300 (3 months' cold rent)\n\nContract duration: 6 to 18 months – flexible as you need it.\n\nWHAT DOES THE ALTERNATIVE COST YOU?\n\nLet's be honest:\n\nScenario 1: Rent unfurnished apartment\n€800 rent for 60 m2 empty in Bamberg\n€3,000-5,000 for furniture (used!)\n€500-1,000 for kitchen, lamps, household items\n€100-150 internet connection\n€80-120 per month for cleaning service (2x per month)\nTime: 40-60 hours for assembly, organization, shopping\nAfter 12 months: Sell everything again (loss of value) or store\n\nScenario 2: Long-term hotel\n€80-120 per night = €2,400-3,600 per month\nNo private retreat\nNo kitchen, no \"home feeling\"\n\nThis apartment:\n€1,890 – and you have a complete home\nNo additional costs, no surprises\nNo wasted time\nAt the end of your time here: Hand in keys, move on\n\nYou're not paying for an apartment. You're paying for time, flexibility, and quality of life.\n\nYOUR NEIGHBORS: HISTORY AND TRANQUILITY\n\nThe Carmelite Monastery is located in a quiet residential area, yet only 10 minutes on foot from Bamberg's Old Town. You won't hear trams or traffic noise – just occasionally the bells of surrounding churches. And yet you're in the midst of life: restaurants, bars, the weekly market, the E.T.A. Hoffmann Theater – all within walking distance.\n\nAVAILABLE FROM NOVEMBER 1, 2025\n\nFirst occupancy after renovation – you're the first person to live here.\n\nNEXT STEPS\n\nIf you recognize yourself in this description – let's talk.\n\nI'm happy to show you the apartment personally (or via video call if you're not in Bamberg yet) and answer all your questions. No mass viewings, no stress.\n\nContact:\nCarsten C.\n(hidden)\n\nKEY FACTS AT A GLANCE\n\nSize: 61 m2\nRooms: 2 (living/bedroom) + bathroom + hallway\nFloor: 2 of 4 (with elevator)\nCold rent: €1,100\nUtilities /Furniture: €790 (flat rate)\nDeposit: €3,300\nAvailable from: see calendar\nDuration: 6-18 months\nEnergy certificate: Class D, 114 kWh/(m2·a)\nYear built: 1767 (completely renovated 2024)\n\nLegal notice: Rental for temporary use according to § 549 Abs. 2 Nr. 1 BGB (German Civil Code). The landlord requires the apartment after the agreed period for their own purposes or for further temporary rental.\n\nPhotos © Carsten C. 2025\nVisualisation © terraplan Grundstücksentwicklungsgesellschaft mbH 2024","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"